    stencil-like glyphs; Phosphor's bold weight is the closest open set, and its radioactive trefoil marks the Library.
    Each Icon<Role> is one path string on a 256 grid, filled by IconTemplate in the inherited foreground. The host sets
    the size (IconSize).

    Menu icons (main menu, game menu) are theme file paths: Playnite's MenuHelpers.GetIcon loads a string resource as an
    image through ThemeFile. Images/Phosphor holds them at 48px in the dim label color (the lens red for exit and remove,
    the LED amber for the favorites star).
